WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A reminder. A reply. A verified payment.
An illustrated TuitionPing walkthrough with fictional data.

00:04.000 --> 00:14.000
TuitionPing texts Sarah a $1,200 tuition reminder
for Sunshine Daycare, due November 1. No parent app is needed.

00:14.000 --> 00:24.000
Sarah replies PAID. The payment is reported for review.
A parent's report is not proof that the money arrived.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
The provider dashboard shows Reported paid.
First, the provider checks their existing payment records.

00:28.000 --> 00:36.000
The provider's payment records show $1,200 received from Sarah.
TuitionPing does not process or independently verify the payment.

00:36.000 --> 00:39.000
After checking receipt, the provider clicks
Confirm payment received on the family's dashboard row.

00:39.000 --> 00:43.000
The status changes to Paid.
The provider has verified and confirmed the payment.

00:43.000 --> 00:48.000
Keep your existing payment method. TuitionPing handles reminders.
Try the interactive demo at tuitionping.com/demo.
